  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- Xが{乏|とぼ}しい (lacking in X)\n- Xに{乏|とぼ}しい (poor in X)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {経験|けいけん}が{乏|とぼ}しい (lack experience)\n- {資源|しげん}が{乏|とぼ}しい (scarce in resources)\n- {知識|ちしき}が{乏|とぼ}しい (lacking knowledge)\n- {資金|しきん}が{乏|とぼ}しい (short of funds)\n- {語彙|ごい}が{乏|とぼ}しい (limited vocabulary)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {少|すく}ない: few, little (more neutral)\n- {足|た}りない: not enough, insufficient\n- {欠|か}けている: lacking, missing\n- {豊|ゆた}か (abundant, rich)\n- {豊富|ほうふ} (plentiful)",
